&lt;span size="large" weight="bold" foreground="#1a5fb4"&gt;Built on&lt;/span&gt;
Rosetta is built on, and installed alongside, this software. Each keeps its own copyright and license; nothing here changes them.

  • &lt;b&gt;LinuxCNC&lt;/b&gt; - copyright the LinuxCNC developers; the motion control, AXIS, HAL and GladeVCP Rosetta runs on. GNU General Public License (GPL) version 2; some libraries GNU Lesser GPL (LGPL). Source: https://github.com/LinuxCNC/linuxcnc
  • &lt;b&gt;Mesa Electronics 7i92 FPGA firmware (hostmot2)&lt;/b&gt; - copyright Peter C. Wallace, Mesa Electronics; Rosetta's pin layout is built from it. GPL version 2 or later, or the 3-clause BSD License. Source: Rosetta_Setup/MesaCard in Rosetta's files, and https://www.mesanet.com
  • &lt;b&gt;mesaflash&lt;/b&gt; - copyright Mesa Electronics and contributors; writes the firmware to the card. GPL version 2 or later. Source: https://github.com/LinuxCNC/mesaflash
  • &lt;b&gt;Linux kernel (real-time build)&lt;/b&gt; - copyright Linus Torvalds and others. GPL version 2. Source: https://github.com/raspberrypi/linux
  • &lt;b&gt;Debian GNU/Linux and Raspberry Pi OS, with the Xfce desktop&lt;/b&gt; - copyright their many authors. Mostly GPL and LGPL; each package's terms are in /usr/share/doc/&amp;lt;package&amp;gt;/copyright. Source: https://sources.debian.org
  • &lt;b&gt;Python 3&lt;/b&gt; - copyright the Python Software Foundation. Python Software Foundation License.
  • &lt;b&gt;GTK 3 and PyGObject&lt;/b&gt; - copyright the GNOME Project and contributors. LGPL version 2.1 or later.
  • &lt;b&gt;cairo and pycairo&lt;/b&gt; - copyright their authors. LGPL version 2.1, or the Mozilla Public License 1.1.
  • &lt;b&gt;NumPy&lt;/b&gt; - copyright the NumPy developers. 3-clause BSD License.
  • &lt;b&gt;DejaVu fonts&lt;/b&gt; - copyright the DejaVu authors and Bitstream, Inc. The free Bitstream Vera / DejaVu font license.

